cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this corpus, please cite it as below."
title: "Convergent Form, Divergent Voice II — Corpus"
abstract: >
  A research data corpus of free-form contemplative writing samples from
  148 dated language-model identities across 493 physical deployment cells, with explicit
  provenance for direct APIs, provider-pinned open-weights routes, and local
  full-precision checkpoints. Companion data for the v2 series of Convergent
  Form, Divergent Voice papers (drift, routing, product-tier).
